<title>FRANCE: ELF AQUITAINE SECOND OIL FIND OFF ANGOLA.</title>
<headline>ELF AQUITAINE SECOND OIL FIND OFF ANGOLA.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elf Aquitaine said on Tuesday it had made a second oil discovery offshore of Angola and production tests gave a cumulative flow rate of 16,000 barrels per day.</p>
<p>The well, called Dalia, is in block 17, three kilometres east of Girassol 1, the company's first discovery well.</p>
<p>Further appraisals have to be carried out to evaluate the commercial potential.</p>
<p>Elf said the find, at a depth of 1,300 metres &quot;confirmed the high potential of block 17&quot;. The Girassol well was announced in April 1996.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
